<title>UK: M.Y. Holdings buys T.W.G. for six mln stg.</title>
<headline>M.Y. Holdings buys T.W.G. for six mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialist packaging group M.Y. Holdings Plc said on Thursday that it has bought T.W.G. Packaging Ltd for six million stg.</p>
<p>M.Y. said in a statement that the purchase price is to be paid in cash on completion from its exisiting resources.</p>
<p>T.W.G. is a leading manufacturer of reel fed self-adhesive labels and patient information leaflets mainly to the healthcare market.</p>
<p>M.Y. also announced that pre-tax profits had risen 38 percent to 12.6 million stg in the year to August 31.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
